{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And it was on the next day.</b> The day of his descent." "<b>And now I will go up.</b> To return to the mountain, to prostrate oneself before HaShem to make atonement for Israel, as I explained; perhaps He will write other tablets to cut a covenant with Israel, and this is \"Behold, I am cutting a covenant\" (below, 34:10), for the tablets are like a deed of testimony."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:55.054438852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}